classDiagram
    direction TB
    class ITransport {
        <<interface>>
        +Start() / Close() / WaitClosed()
        +AsyncRead() shared_ptr~Awaitable~Datagram~~
        +AsyncWrite(Datagram) Coro::Result~void~
        +LastError() / CurrentLinkState()
    }
    class TcpTransport { +已连接字节管道 }
    class TcpClientTransport {
        +连接状态机+自动重连+ApplyConfig
        +具体诊断（非多态缝）：State/WaitForState
        +Generation/AttemptCount/LastFailure
    }
    class UdpTransport {
        +报文+地址（peer）
        +socket 管理泵 + 读写双队列
        +silence_timeout：读超时兼重试间隔
    }
    class SerialTransport { +串口字节流 }
    class DdsTransport { +provider 跨线程有界交接 }
    class TcpServer { +accept 每连接一 node }
    class IDdsProvider {
        <<interface>>
        +Init/Shutdown/Subscribe/Publish
    }

    ITransport <|.. TcpTransport
    ITransport <|.. TcpClientTransport
    ITransport <|.. UdpTransport
    ITransport <|.. SerialTransport
    ITransport <|.. DdsTransport
    TcpClientTransport *-- TcpTransport : 一代际一内层
    DdsTransport *-- IDdsProvider : 组合
    TcpServer ..> TcpTransport : 每连接接管
    note for ITransport "读写刻意不对称：读交出等待器句柄，\n超时/取消/扇出由调用方自理；\n写入队即返，结果只落 LastError()"
    note for UdpTransport "ADR-0008 已落地；TCP / 串口 / DDS\n按同一形态后续跟进（当前排除于编译面）"
